[Event "Rook sacrifice"]
[Site "https://lichess.org/training/HY1fk"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "4QQ2/kpp5/pb6/7p/P2q4/7r/6PB/5R1K b - - 0 1"]

{ White has just made a second queen, but it's Black's move. Black to move and mate in 2. }
1... Rxh2+ { [%cal Gh3h2] [%cal Bb6g1,Bd4g1] Sacrifice the rook! The king can't escape to g1, because the bishop and queen cover it, so it has to take. }
2. Kxh2
2... Qh4# { [%cal Gd4h4] [%csl Rh2] The queen checks along the h-file. The bishop still covers g1, and the queen covers g3 and h3, so it's mate. }
